 balance sheet, thin -4.0\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Net dilution runs at 19.3% annually, transferring value from owners to stock-based comp, and insiders hold 41% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Accruals elevated at +16.0% of assets \u2014 Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Very elevated short interest (25.0% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Revenue growth in the bottom decile of Basic Materials peers \u2014 losing share inside the profit pool","sev":"red","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (88% sell ratio, net $2.7M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom quartile among Basic Materials peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Weakness in commodity prices pressures materials companies","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Commodity price volatility and cost-curve position \u2014 in a downturn only the lowest-cost producer has a business, and the rest carry the overhead.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Environmental remediation liability \u2014 tightening regulations on emissions, tailings, and water use create open-ended balance-sheet risk that grows with each legislative cycle.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Trade policy and tariff whiplash \u2014 materials producers are first-order casualties of protectionist swings, and margin gets squeezed from both input and output pricing.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bo